out.push(box('Marking the unit check', [
  '**A  Language — 8 marks**, one each.',
  '**B  Listening — 6 marks**, one for each gap. ⚠ **Give the fifth mark only for both halves** — **that she gave the ordinary price AND that she did not mention the letter because mentioning it would have been about the firm.** **The second half is the judgement; the first alone is a price list.**',
  '**C  Reading — 5 marks:** the three parts of the ask (3) · ⚠ **the lapse identified as the part that ends it (1)** · ⚠ **the interval at the end because the reader has decided (1)** — **and no mark for *it is less important*.**',
  '**D  Writing — 6 marks:** a concession with a figure or a specific in it (2) · ⚠ **one changed fact with its date (1)** · **a narrowed ask (1)** · ⚠ **a lapse (2)** — **and the two lapse marks are the ones that separate the class.**',
  '**Total 25.** ⚠ **The profile to expect: A split, B high, C high, D split.** **A loses Q2 and Q6.** ⚠ **D loses the lapse in about half of papers**, **because a learner who has understood the narrower ask still writes it as a standing arrangement** — **and a standing arrangement is a decision, which is what the whole unit is avoiding.**',
], C.lteal, C.navy));
out.push(note('Teacher\'s note. Four faults to watch, and the remedy for each. First, the second letter with nothing in it. Learners write again because the need has not gone away, and the need is not a ground. Drill the one question: what is in this letter that was not in the application? Where the answer is "that we still believe it", there is no letter, and the cycle that handles that is 15.5. Make the cost real by asking what else the firm will need from that reader in two years, and whether they would rather ask out of a file with one refusal in it or two. Second, the concession with an edge. "Had to be cautious", "felt unable", "in fairness could hardly have done otherwise" all excuse and therefore withhold, and the fault is invisible on a page because the writer reads their own intention into the sentence. The only reliable test is reading it aloud with the stress deliberately misplaced, which takes two seconds. Insist on the strong form where it is true, and expect it to be true nearly always: a collection period going 46, 51, 58 with nothing attached to the last figure is a series anybody would refuse. Third, the ask that is the refused thing in a smaller size. The narrower ask is not a discount, it is a different question, and the three parts are the amount, the period and the review. The review is the part that makes it grantable and the part that gets left out, so mark for it everywhere. A committee can say yes to something that undoes itself and cannot say yes to something that will have to be unwound. Fourth, and this is the one that will matter longest: the invented reason for an interval. Where the delay was neglect, the instruction is silence, and learners find silence impossible — they would rather supply a reason, and the reason is checkable. Say plainly that the only thing worse than four unexplained months is four explained ones where the explanation is untrue, and that the check, when it comes, comes from somebody holding the dates. Two notes on 15.7. The mediation works because Nour asks two factual questions — what did she actually say, and who has asked since — and does not ask whether Ms Tannous refused, which is the question that has been getting the same wrong answer for seven months. And resist the class\'s instinct to ask why Hala said nothing. The answer is that nobody asked her and the call had nowhere to go, and the question converts a finding into a complaint about a colleague, which is the one way to waste it.'));

if (require.main === module) L.build(out, process.argv[2], 'Proactive Business English B2 · Book 2 · Syria Edition · Unit 15 · Answer Key');
module.exports = out;
